| `changelog_fragments.unsectioned` | string or null | `general` in keel; `null` in a generated project; absent, null, which its reader reports as `[using default] changelog_fragments.unsectioned = null` | folder for bullets above the first category heading | `scripts/assemble_fragments.py` via `scripts/config_loader.py` | Controls Unreleased assembly; missing configured folders fail closed. | reference rows: `reference_fragments` | always |
